;
; How Escapement files a shift in its shift tree, in MYRA
; (escapement_rules.h ER5): person, week, shift, then its start and finish
; (minutes of the week) and the minutes worked. The model asks whether the
; numbers fit before it keeps the shift.
^ZXSHIFT(person:i6, week:i4, shift:i3) = start:i5! ^ finish:i5! ^ worked:i5!
